THE ANALYSIS ENGINE
===================

Structural analysis runs in the native ENGINE LIBRARY (`libbsi_tectonic.so`,
`bsi_tectonic.dll`) bundled in the qualified mod jar. The game loads it through five
C functions in `contract/bsi_capi.h`, bound with JNA; there is no custom JNI code.
The library is unpacked without an execute bit. No sidecar executable is shipped or
started by the game.

`blockreality-engine/natives.manifest` records each library's SHA-256, version and
interface revision. Release builds stage already downloaded, verified SDK archives;
the runtime checks the extracted bytes and performs an engine identity handshake.
It does not download an engine. `META-INF/native-release/provenance.json` records
the exact upstream source commit, source-archive checksum and native asset checksums;
the per-platform provenance and licence texts are retained alongside it.

For the published v1.5 SDK, the source is commit
42ba7eb912bd7d763435ce48a945df6954b680ea at
<https://github.com/rocky59487/tectonic2>. The corresponding source archive is
<https://github.com/rocky59487/tectonic2/releases/download/v1.5/tectonic2-1.5.0-source.tar.gz>.
Use the provenance inside a particular jar to identify the bytes that jar carries.


